We have endorsed Konrad Aldermoor of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?].

[? if not impeachment_bvp: With our support of Aldermoor, some of the most conservative parts of the <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">the Arcanists</span> have broken away from the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?], shifting their support to the <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> Seckard. Hopefully it doesn't lead to a repeat of the 4290 Presidential election. ?]

