@r2_vote
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: post_election



@r1_winner
go-to: election_end

@seeckt_victory
on-arrival: chancellor = "Frask"; chancellor_party = "CSG"

With Seckard's victory, the balance of power passes to the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> once more, who expect a reward for their support for him. He has gone ahead with appointing Bram Frask of the <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">**CSG**</span> as chancellor, which will inevitably start a full-scale civil war.

- @fight: Did we do all this for nothing? Fight!

@fight

Do we realize that this means civil war, against the full force of the state?

- @civil_war: Yes.

@election_end
go-to: eckener_win if winner = "Eckhart"; bundesrepublik_win if winner = "Aldermoor"; seeckt_victory if winner = "Seckard"; nazis_lose if winner = "Grenshaw" or winner == "Vesh" or winner = "Gesling"
on-arrival: {!
Q.president = Q.winner;
if (Q.president == "Halsmark") Q.president = "Halsmark";
if (Q.president == "Munzenberg") Q.president = "Munzer";
if (Q.president == "Gorrick") Q.president = "Gorrick";

if (Q.president == "Halsmark" || Q.president == "Munzer" || Q.president == "Shackley" || Q.president == "Vesh" || Q.president == "Grenshaw" || Q.president == "Jessamy" || Q.president == "Bristol" || Q.president == "Ostwick" || Q.president == "Mann" || Q.president == "Verrin") {
    Q.president_ideology = "Left";
} else if (Q.president == "Eckhart" || Q.president == "Aldermoor" || Q.president == "Gesling" || Q.president == "Hewes") {
    Q.president_ideology = "Moderate";
} else {
    Q.president_ideology = "Right";
}
!}

The election has been won by [+ winner_desc +].

@eckener_win
achievement: zeppelin_kapitan
go-to: nazis_lose

@bundesrepublik_win
go-to: bundesrepublik_achieve if presidential_powers; nazis_lose if not presidential_powers

@bundesrepublik_achieve
achievement: bundesrepublik
go-to: nazis_lose

@nazis_lose

After its electoral defeat, the so-called "new Stowford Front" is collapsing into infighting and financial ruin. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>'s moment has seemingly passed, and the path to democratic restoration under President [+ president +] now begins. What a close call.

- @game_over